                <mxCell id="overlap" value="AARCH64_TCB_OVERLAP (마지막 16B) — tls.c:69-75&#xa;ABI: DTV 포인터 + 구현용 포인터 자리 (tls.c:111-114)&#xa;※ arm64+lib-musl 빌드는 overlap=0 → tlsp가 TCB 끝, 패딩2가 16B" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
